WEBVTT

00:03:58.596 --> 00:04:00.636
Which, maybe that's pretty appropriate,

00:04:00.676 --> 00:04:01.876
I don't know.

00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:03.276
(Laughter)

00:04:03.316 --> 00:04:04.756
But we thought it was funny.

00:04:05.596 --> 00:04:07.956
But it was also exhilarating

00:04:07.996 --> 00:04:09.156
because here we were,

00:04:09.196 --> 00:04:12.916
in this place that we never
would have gone to otherwise,

00:04:12.916 --> 00:04:15.316
doing something really different
on a Friday night.

00:04:15.636 --> 00:04:17.116
(Laughter)

00:04:17.116 --> 00:04:18.796
And I was hooked,

00:04:18.836 --> 00:04:22.316
I started using this app

00:04:22.316 --> 00:04:24.516
to go to all different places
in San Francisco.

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:26.396
I went to museums randomly,

00:04:26.436 --> 00:04:29.796
random grocery stores,
random bars, random bowling alleys,

00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:31.236
random florists.